 (r"\btune-401\b","Tune-401 is an LNP-delivered epigenetic silencer (TEMPO platform: DNA-binding domain fused to epigenetic effectors) designed to durably switch off HBV cccDNA and integrated HBV DNA without cutting, aiming at functional cure of chronic hepatitis B; Phase 1b, open-label."),
 (r"losmapimod","Losmapimod is an oral p38α/β MAPK inhibitor intended to reduce DUX4 expression in FSHD muscle."),
